class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5_by_OmegaLearn_(Arithmetic_Computation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5 by OmegaLearn (Arithmetic Computation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_8_(Problems_1-3)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 8 (Problems 1-3)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf9a3889b146c23eb653b9dc16255c03a229dfe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2^2-2)-(3^2-3)+(4^2-4)\\]\" width=\"227\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/6/a86e0b96079027773c7dee723b79555088c786fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b04b50e8c3d0734568e23e98cec20a9e1d18741f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4-2)-(9-3)+(16-4)=2-6+12=8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"359\" height=\"18\" /> This corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/841738515d2b311ea2079b59dc16a3eb488b9504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-happykeeper\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/a/37a7d027f3fe36322428a37a7ff08ce1ce5f0736.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left(2^2-2\\right)-\\left(3^2-3\\right)+\\left(4^2-4\\right) &amp;= 2(2-1)-3(3-1)+4(4-1) \\\\ &amp;= 2(1)-3(2)+4(3) \\\\ &amp;= 2-6+12 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 8}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"492\" height=\"107\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Overkill:_Just_for_Fun.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Overkill:_Just_for_Fun)\">Solution 3 (Overkill: Just for Fun)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Overkill: Just for Fun)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd5dbbef7f3e34c4776b1b65be49275d35255770.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (2^2-2)-(3^2-3)+(4^2-4) &amp;= 2^2+4^2-3^2-2+3-4 \\\\ &amp;=2^2+(4-3)(4+3)-3 \\\\ &amp;=2^2+7-3=2^2+4 \\\\ &amp;=4\\cdot 2 \\\\ &amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 8}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"441\" height=\"136\" />\n-<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:PureSwag\" title=\"User:PureSwag\">PureSwag</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28When_you_have_too_much_time.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(When_you_have_too_much_time)\">Solution 4 (When you have too much time)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (When you have too much time)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the difference of squares, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce654c8a197d06312c02b9cf3b07066856347c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2-\\sqrt{2})(2+\\sqrt{2}) - (3-\\sqrt{3})(3+\\sqrt{3}) + (4-2)(4+2).\\]\" width=\"434\" height=\"21\" />\nKnowing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/b/04b1f1d7b9c877fc2c74df9d0a4b3d95b814b542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2} \\approx 1.41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/a/46a172e69dc1713174ba701e6b86b55647986a9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3} \\approx 1.73,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"23\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92c78ba7e8054466f98fc098f06c66d0c2ab6367.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2-\\sqrt{2})(2+\\sqrt{2}) - (3-\\sqrt{3})(3+\\sqrt{3}) + (4-2)(4+2) \\approx 0.59\\cdot 3.41 -1.26\\cdot 4.73 + 2 \\cdot 6 =8.0521,\\]\" width=\"659\" height=\"21\" /> which is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/841738515d2b311ea2079b59dc16a3eb488b9504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Lightning_Fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Lightning_Fast)\">Video Solution 1 (Lightning Fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Lightning Fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cAMg15KhK6E\">https://youtu.be/cAMg15KhK6E</a>\n</p><p>~ Education, the Study of everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_3_.28Very_Very_Quick_Computation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3_(Very_Very_Quick_Computation)\">Video Solution 3 (Very Very Quick Computation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3 (Very Very Quick Computation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m0_UMI2mnZs&amp;list=PLexHyfQ8DMuKqltG3cHT7Di4jhVl6L4YJ&amp;index=2\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m0_UMI2mnZs&amp;list=PLexHyfQ8DMuKqltG3cHT7Di4jhVl6L4YJ&amp;index=2</a>\n~North America Mathematic Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_4_.28Quick_Computation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4_(Quick_Computation)\">Video Solution 4 (Quick Computation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4 (Quick Computation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/C3n2hgBhyXc?t=37\">https://youtu.be/C3n2hgBhyXc?t=37</a>\n~ThePuzzlr\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_5_by_OmegaLearn_.28Arithmetic_Computation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5_by_OmegaLearn_(Arithmetic_Computation)\">Video Solution 5 by OmegaLearn (Arithmetic Computation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5 by OmegaLearn (Arithmetic Computation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0VvM_f-IDvE\">https://youtu.be/0VvM_f-IDvE</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_6\">Video Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4dkzuRHJieQ\">https://youtu.be/4dkzuRHJieQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_7\">Video Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/50CThrk3RcM\">https://youtu.be/50CThrk3RcM</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_8_.28Problems_1-3.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_8_(Problems_1-3)\">Video Solution 8 (Problems 1-3)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 8 (Problems 1-3)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CupJpUzKPB0\">https://youtu.be/CupJpUzKPB0</a>\n</p><p>~MathWithPi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_9\">Video Solution 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/slVBYmcDMOI\">https://youtu.be/slVBYmcDMOI</a>\n</p><p>~TheLearningRoyal\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A\" title=\"2021 AMC 10A\">2021 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a re